  <h2>4. Managing Your Cookie Preferences</h2>
  <p>
    You have full control over your cookie settings. You can adjust your consent at any time by clicking the button below, or by clicking the floating cookie icon in the bottom-left corner of any page:
  </p>

  <p>
    <button type="button" class="fwf-policy-manage-btn" data-open-cookie-preferences>
      Manage Cookie Preferences
    </button>
  </p>

  <p>
    You can also control or delete cookies through your web browser settings. Most browsers allow you to refuse cookies, delete existing cookies, or receive a warning before a cookie is stored:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Chrome Cookie Settings</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/en-gb/guide/safari/sfri11471/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple Safari Cookie Settings</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/microsoft-edge-browsing-data-and-privacy-bb8174ba-9d73-dcf2-9b4a-c582b4e640dd" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Microsoft Edge Cookie Settings</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enhanced-tracking-protection-firefox-desktop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mozilla Firefox Cookie Settings</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Please note that disabling cookies completely may impact the operation of certain interactive features on our website.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Your Rights with Respect to Personal Data</h2>
  <p>
    Under UK Data Protection legislation, you have rights regarding your personal information, including the right to access, rectify, or request deletion of data held about you, and the right to withdraw consent at any time.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you have any questions or complaints about how we process your personal data or use cookies, you may contact us using the details below. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the UK supervisory authority, the <strong>Information Commissioner’s Office (ICO)</strong>, at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ico.org.uk</a>.
  </p>

